![Chilean RUT](cover.png)

Having a _RUT_ validator in a programming language is of utmost
importance for the Chilean market.

It is one of the most common operations in Chilean software, and
_Elixir_ deserves a robust library that can be used in the projects
that need it.

```github
ElixirCL/rut | Validador y generador de RUT chileno en Elixir
```
